<title>SINGAPORE: Brunei cuts the price of term lifting Seria Light.</title>
<headline>Brunei cuts the price of term lifting Seria Light.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunei has cut the term lifting price of Seria Light crude and Champion crude by $1.20 per barrel for May compared with April, traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>It set the May price of Seria Light at $20.90, from $22.10 in April. Champion was set at $20.70 from a month-earlier $21.90.</p>
<p>Brunei sets its term lifting prices retroactively.</p>
<p>Brunei set a June provision price for Seria Light of $21.60 and a provision price for Champion of $21.40.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
